      "id": "claim_86fb7ccadc964ad8bb0546f9a79b972c",
      "statement": "The active launcher is src/app.py: when run as the main script it creates a Tk root, instantiates StockSimulator imported from login, and enters Tk's event loop; src/login.py can also launch that same UI directly under its own main guard.",
