      "id": "claim_d6357cfd67564621b9d5f55e8175e457",
      "statement": "The active StockSimulator login UI creates email and masked-password entries, but its submit callback only reads and prints the entered values; it does not authenticate, connect to a database, or open a post-login workflow.",
